## コピーして動かす — Luxel Cavern capstone

> **Recipe** · 難易度: Advanced · 依存 bundle: なし

Repository recipe integrating Framework, UI, 2D, input, audio, resources, particles and settings.

**必要条件:** Repository checkout / .NET 10 / Windows real-window host
  **Platform:** Windows
  **検証契約:** exit `0` / timeout `180s`
  **接続点:** `CavernRealtimeScene`

**Run**
```powershell
dotnet run --project samples/LuxelCavern/LuxelCavern
```

**Smoke test**
```powershell
dotnet build samples/LuxelCavern/LuxelCavern/LuxelCavern.csproj --configuration Release --no-restore
```

