# UI widget trees

- [コピーして動かす — Headless reactive widget tree](#コピーして動かす-—-headless-reactive-widget-tree)
  - [`samples/LuxelUiHeadless/LuxelUiHeadless.csproj` (Project)](#`samples/luxeluiheadless/luxeluiheadless.csproj`-project)
  - [`samples/LuxelUiHeadless/Program.cs` (CSharp)](#`samples/luxeluiheadless/program.cs`-csharp)
  - [`assets/fonts/BIZUDGothic-Regular.ttf` (Asset)](#`assets/fonts/bizudgothic-regular.ttf`-asset)

Luxel UIは`Widget`を宣言し、Layoutでsizeとoffsetを決め、Realizeでretained 2D nodeへ接続します。`CompositeControl.Build()`は既存controlを組み合わせる入口です。完全自前描画が不要なら`Widget`を直接継承せず、generated `Kit` factoryでtreeを返します。

## コピーして動かす — Headless reactive widget tree

> **Block** · 難易度: Beginner · 依存 bundle: `support.source-tree`

CompositeControl tracks a Signal read during Build, invalidates its root, and rebuilds a declarative StackPanel on the next layout.

**必要条件:** .NET 10 / Bundled font / Headless on all supported .NET OS
  **Platform:** Windows / Linux / macOS
  **検証契約:** exit `0` / timeout `300s` / stdout `ui: builds=2, children=1->3, invalidated=True`
  **接続点:** `CompositeControl`

**Run**
```powershell
dotnet run --project samples/LuxelUiHeadless
```

**Smoke test**
```powershell
dotnet run --project samples/LuxelUiHeadless
```

### `samples/LuxelUiHeadless/LuxelUiHeadless.csproj` (Project)

```xml
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup><OutputType>Exe</OutputType><ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings><Nullable>enable</Nullable></PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup><ProjectReference Include="..\..\src\Luxel.Controls\Luxel.Controls.csproj" /></ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup><Content Include="..\..\assets\fonts\BIZUDGothic-Regular.ttf" Link="fonts\BIZUDGothic-Regular.ttf" CopyToOutputDirectory="PreserveNewest" /></ItemGroup>
</Project>
```

### `samples/LuxelUiHeadless/Program.cs` (CSharp)

```csharp
using Luxel.Controls;
using Luxel.Typography;
using Luxel.UI;
using static Luxel.Controls.Kit;

// docs:begin ui-headless-tree
using VectorFont font = VectorFont.Load(Path.Combine(AppContext.BaseDirectory, "fonts", "BIZUDGothic-Regular.ttf"));
var context = new LayoutContext { Font = font };
var counter = new CounterTree();
counter.Layout(Constraints.LooseW(240, 240), context);
int firstChildren = ((StackPanel)counter.Root!).ChildCount;

counter.Count.Value = 3;
bool invalidated = counter.Root is null;
counter.Layout(Constraints.LooseW(240, 240), context);
int secondChildren = ((StackPanel)counter.Root!).ChildCount;

Console.WriteLine($"ui: builds={counter.Builds}, children={firstChildren}->{secondChildren}, invalidated={invalidated}");
// docs:end ui-headless-tree

return counter.Builds == 2 && firstChildren == 1 && secondChildren == 3 && invalidated ? 0 : 1;

sealed class CounterTree : CompositeControl
{
    internal Signal<int> Count { get; } = new(1);
    internal int Builds { get; private set; }

    protected override Widget Build()
    {
        Builds++;
        Widget[] rows = Enumerable.Range(1, Count.Value).Select(i => (Widget)Text($"row {i}")).ToArray();
        return VStack(spacing: 2)[rows];
    }
}
```

