**難易度:** Beginner　 **実行環境:** Gallery / Standalone / Headless　 **Backend:** Vulkan / DirectX 12 / Skia CPU　 **前提知識:** FirstRenderGraph

**前へ:** [Shipping](story:Learn/Rendering/ThreeD/Shipping)　 **次:** [Paths](story:Learn/Rendering/TwoD/Paths)

