## コピーして動かす — Luxel Range capstone

> **Recipe** · 難易度: Advanced · 依存 bundle: なし

Repository recipe integrating ECS, physics, glTF, GPU asset extraction and 3D particles.

**必要条件:** Repository checkout / .NET 10 / Windows real-window host / Khronos Fox asset
  **Platform:** Windows
  **検証契約:** exit `0` / timeout `240s`
  **接続点:** `RangeRealtimeScene`

**Run**
```powershell
dotnet run --project samples/LuxelRange/LuxelRange
```

**Smoke test**
```powershell
dotnet build samples/LuxelRange/LuxelRange/LuxelRange.csproj --configuration Release --no-restore
```

